<section style="padding:72px 24px 40px;"><div style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;"><div class="rich"><p>Solar installation in Benin City usually starts the same way: a BEDC supply that does not hold, a gen that eats petrol, and a house in GRA, Uselu, Ugbowo or along Sapele Road that still goes dark when light goes. This page is advertising for independent installers, so the job is done by the installer who quotes you, not by this site.</p><p>The honest route is to get two or three written quotes that list the exact inverter, battery and panel models, then compare like with like. Call now on +234 809 000 0000 and you will be put in touch with an independent installer for your area of Benin City.</p></div></div></section>
<section style="padding:0 24px 64px;"><div style="max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;">
    <span class="kicker">What We Do in Benin City</span>
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,32px);margin:0 0 28px;">Services for Benin City Properties</h2>
    <div class="feat-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:20px;">
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E6DFCF;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(31,34,49,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#1B1D2A;margin:0 0 8px;">Home solar installation</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">A hybrid system for a flat or duplex in GRA, Uselu or Ugbowo, sized from the rating plates of the appliances you actually want to run.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E6DFCF;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(31,34,49,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#1B1D2A;margin:0 0 8px;">Inverter and battery installation</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Swap tubular batteries that no longer last the night for lithium, or add an inverter to a house that only has a gen. Ask for the exact battery model and its warranty in writing.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E6DFCF;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(31,34,49,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#1B1D2A;margin:0 0 8px;">Commercial solar</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Shops, schools, clinics, churches and small offices around Sapele Road and Ikpoba Hill that want to cut diesel. The installer does a load audit before quoting.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E6DFCF;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(31,34,49,0.05);">
